  "c4_verdict": {
    "verdict_choice": "(b)",
    "one_sentence_summary": "At 0.5B generator scale, no query transformation cleared Bonferroni on either corpus. HyDE measured -0.0029 on corpus A and -0.0026 on NFCorpus - effectively identical across a synthetic lexical corpus with heuristic relevance and a medical benchmark with human judgments. The replication suggests the null is a property of the method at this model scale rather than of the corpus. It does NOT establish that HyDE fails with a larger generator, which was not tested."
  },
